<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling stable on dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling stable on dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling remained virtually unchanged against the dollar and pound on Tuesday, commercial dealers said.</p>
<p>They said the shilling was quoted at a mean of 590.4756 versus 590.5746 on Monday. Against the pound, the shilling was posted at a mean rate of 921.5278 compared to 921.5636 on Monday.</p>
</text>
